-b11e-e1b0237715ed"] [17592186115355 :knowledge-point/questions "question-6a136627-eda2-5d29-b505-8b7058c4663c"] [17592186281515 :question/problem "The domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)=\\operatorname{cot}⁡(2t)\\,i+\\operatorname{cos}⁡t\\,j+({t}^{3}+1)\\,k$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne \\bbox[5pt,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{AAAAA}}.\n$$\n\nWhat is the missing expression? You may assume that $n$ is an integer."] [17592186281510 :question/problem "The domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)={t}^{4}\\,i+2\\operatorname{csc}⁡t\\,j+{e}^{t}\\,k$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne \\bbox[5pt,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{AAAAA}}.\n$$\n\nWhat is the missing expression? You may assume that $n$ is an integer."] ["question-8fca9eb0-e6f5-519c-a32f-bb2e9feb0354" :question/id #uuid "8fca9eb0-e6f5-519c-a32f-bb2e9feb0354"] ["question-8fca9eb0-e6f5-519c-a32f-bb2e9feb0354" :question/math-academy-id "q-161534"] ["question-8fca9eb0-e6f5-519c-a32f-bb2e9feb0354" :question/problem "The domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)=\\operatorname{csc}⁡t\\,i+{e}^{-{t}^{2}}\\,j+(t-1)^{3}\\,k$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne \\bbox[5pt,border:1pt solid black]{\\phantom{AAAAA}}.\n$$\n\nWhat is the missing expression? You may assume that $n$ is an integer."] ["question-8fca9eb0-e6f5-519c-a32f-bb2e9feb0354" :question/worked-solution "To find the domain of $f$, we need the intersection of the domains of the individual components.\n\n- The domain of the $1$st component $\\operatorname{csc}⁡t$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),$ $t\\ne n\\pi ,$  where $n$ is an integer.\n\n- The domain of the $2$nd component  ${e}^{-{t}^{2}}$ is $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ).$\n\n- The domain of the $3$rd component $(t-1)^{3}$ is  $t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )$\n\nTherefore, the domain of the vector-valued function $f(t)$ is \n\n$$\nt\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty ),\\,t\\ne n\\pi ,\n$$\n\nwhere $n$ is an integer."] ["question-8fca9eb0-e6f5-519c-a32f-bb2e9feb0354" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-45690dea-1ba3-504a-87b5-58ba96cb252b" :answer-field/id #uuid "45690dea-1ba3-504a-87b5-58ba96cb252b"] ["answer-caf5664b-18a2-5954-9ee6-dba84e81a45b" :answer/id #uuid "caf5664b-18a2-5954-9ee6-dba84e81a45b"] ["answer-caf5664b-18a2-5954-9ee6-dba84e81a45b" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-caf5664b-18a2-5954-9ee6-dba84e81a45b" :answer/value "0"] ["answer-e4bf4686-2e08-55b1-9c61-d5e51a43466d" :answer/id #uuid "e4bf4686-2e08-55b1-9c61-d5e51a43466d"] ["answer-e4bf4686-2e08-55b1-9c61-d5e51a43466d" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-e4bf4686-2e08-55b1-9c61-d5e51a43466d" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{2}+n\\pi "] ["answer-a89b6c45-d211-542e-bfa5-1a0941f80d5f" :answer/id #uuid "a89b6c45-d211-542e-bfa5-1a0941f80d5f"] ["answer-a89b6c45-d211-542e-bfa5-1a0941f80d5f" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a89b6c45-d211-542e-bfa5-1a0941f80d5f" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi }{4}+\\frac{n\\pi }{2}"] ["answer-f708bc31-553a-5790-aacb-1dea3a94acc6" :answer/id #uuid "f708bc31-553a-5790-aacb-1dea3a94acc6"] ["answer-f708bc31-553a-5790-aacb-1dea3a94acc6" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-f708bc31-553a-5790-aacb-1dea3a94acc6" :answer/value "\\frac{n\\pi }{2}"] ["answer-325f0324-6644-537f-8902-57c28b2b7e58" :answer/id #uuid "325f0324-6644-537f-8902-57c28b2b7e58"] ["answer-325f0324-6644-537f-8902-57c28b2b7e58" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-325f0324-6644-537f-8902-57c28b2b7e58" :answer/value "n\\pi "] ["answer-field-45690dea-1ba3-504a-87b5-58ba96cb252b" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-45690dea-1ba3-504a-87b5-58ba96cb252b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-45690dea-1ba3-504a-87b5-58ba96cb252b" :answer-field/correct "answer-325f0324-6644-537f-8902-57c28b2b7e58"] ["answer-field-45690dea-1ba3-504a-87b5-58ba96cb252b" :answer-field/choices "answer-caf5664b-18a2-5954-9ee6-dba84e81a45b"] ["answer-field-45690dea-1ba3-504a-87b5-58ba96cb252b" :answer-field/choices "answer-e4bf468